---
title: Best Principal Award
date: 2025-11-01
summary: Principal Ms. Supriya Johnson was selected for the Best Principal Award by the Indian Talent Olympiad.
---

Ms. Supriya Johnson, Principal, was selected for the Best Principal Award by the Indian Talent Olympiad. The ceremony in Mumbai includes Dr. Kiran Bedi and Olympian Saina Nehwal as Chief Guests.
